Package: traffic-count
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: per-device LAN traffic accounting using eBPF
 traffic-count attaches eBPF programs to LAN interfaces and counts
 upload/download bytes per device MAC address, stored in SQLite and
 served over a loopback JSON API.
